00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:19.920
Dearest Wally,

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:22.030
I stayed awake all last night

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:23.630
thinking about your last letter.

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:25.950
It's wonderful to think

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:28.270
that such a darling, popular boy

00:06:28.270 --> 00:06:30.000
with his own car in it

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:32.000
really cares about little old me.

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:35.170
- His own car and everything?

00:06:35.170 --> 00:06:38.170
- Well, this kitty really does have her own car.

00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:40.410
'Cause her pops got all kinds of money,

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:42.410
so I had to write and tell her that I have my own car

00:06:42.410 --> 00:06:44.410
so she wouldn't think I was a creep.

00:06:44.410 --> 00:06:49.570
- How come she calls it dearest and all that mushy junk?

00:06:49.570 --> 00:06:52.610
- Oh, well, that's on account of the last letter I wrote her.

00:06:52.610 --> 00:06:55.610
I called her honey and told her that I liked her.

00:06:55.610 --> 00:06:57.950
I did that so that she'd write me some good stuff

00:06:57.950 --> 00:06:59.960
that I could read to the guys at camp.

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:02.770
