00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:36.800
then there's all kinds of romantic junk about me being the absolute most and then down here it says

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:47.610
yours forever kitty wow what's this oh that's her picture she sent me she's wearing an evening gown

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:53.450
with all kinds of pieces of chrome plating stuck on it they call them sequins this is her picture

00:07:55.750 --> 00:08:00.000
well um i had it in my pocket up at camp and some wise guy pushed

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.000
me in the lake.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:03.240
