00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:18.840
Besides saying that I have a car, I said that I have a tuxedo and go to big society dances

00:08:18.840 --> 00:08:22.210
all the time, and Dad's the president of a bank.

00:08:22.210 --> 00:08:27.620
And I even said that last New Year's Eve, Mom gave a party where Frank Sinatra sang for

00:08:27.620 --> 00:08:28.620
nothing.

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:30.000
I kind of, he's a friend of hers.

00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:33.360
One day it turned green when you heard that kitty was coming to Mayfield.

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:34.000
Yeah.

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:45.360
June?

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:48.530
June, I'm home!

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:50.010
So I see.

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:52.230
Oh, hi.

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:54.220
Hi.

00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:55.910
What are you hiding there for?

00:08:56.650 --> 00:08:57.130
Hiding?

00:08:57.540 --> 00:08:58.400
I'm just thinking.

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:00.000
