00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:30.000
you were resigned to the fact that he has basketball practice. I am, but I'm disappointed too. They have that

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:35.430
new ballroom at the club, and there's an orchestra, and girls in their pretty party dresses.

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:38.190
