00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:54.840
Oh, Ward.

00:09:55.380 --> 00:09:56.920
Now, you take a basketball game.

00:09:56.920 --> 00:09:57.700
There you go.

00:09:58.760 --> 00:09:59.480
