00:10:39.100 --> 00:10:40.190
Extra practice?

00:10:40.370 --> 00:10:41.990
Oh, no, sir, he couldn't have said that.

00:10:42.390 --> 00:10:45.010
Just yesterday, the coach and I were discussing the schedule.

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:47.220
He needs someone to lean on, you know.

00:10:48.630 --> 00:10:50.130
